# This file ignores the build files at the top of liken/, which belong
# to no one domain. Everything else gitignored in liken/ is ignored by
# its own domain's file.

# The coverage profile go test writes for the pre-commit gate. It
# lives at the top of liken/ because it profiles the whole module.
coverage.out
# The report `make coverage-report` renders from that profile. CI
# builds its own copy and publishes it; a workstation's copy is a
# build artifact like any other.
coverage.html

# The version stamp file version.mk maintains: the git-described
# version as a file Make can track, rewritten only when the version
# actually changes.
.version
